<view class="wrap wrist-page">
  <view class="intro">先量一下手围，后面每条手串都按它算颗数和长度。之后可以随时修改。</view>
  <view class="card wristcard">
    <view class="bigwrist"><button class="step" data-step="-0.5" bindtap="step" aria-label="减少">−</button><view class="measure"><input type="digit" value="{{input}}" bindinput="input" aria-label="手围厘米"/><text>cm</text></view><button class="step" data-step="0.5" bindtap="step" aria-label="增加">＋</button></view>
    <view class="ruler"><view class="ruler-fill" style="width:{{fill}}%"></view></view>
    <view class="presets"><view wx:for="{{presets}}" wx:key="*this" class="preset {{wrist===item?'on':''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="preset">{{item}}cm</view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="card guide"><view class="title">怎么量</view><view>1. 拿软尺或一张纸条，贴着手腕最细处绕一圈。</view><view>2. 纸条在重合处做记号，摊平用尺子量出长度。</view><view>3. 填量到的数字。余量会按珠子大小估算：6mm 珠加 1cm，8mm 加 1.5cm，10mm 加 2cm，12mm 加 2.5cm。</view><view class="sub">没有尺子？可以先填写估计值，下单前请实际测量并确认。</view></view>
  <view class="bottom"><view><view class="sub">已选手围</view><view class="wrist-value">{{wrist}}cm</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="confirm">确定</button></view>
</view>
